	(text "AMPAK AP6275P (BCM43752): PCIe Gen1 x1 on combo PHY0 (PCIE20_0, JP3), BT HCI UART9_M2 with RTS/CTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b2f385b6-93ec-488b-b065-834a6ce0c81e")
	)
	(text "Pins: AP6275P datasheet s.5.2. Support circuit after Khadas Edge2 V1.3 p.19 (AP6275P on RK3588S):\nCBUCK/ABUCK 2.2 uH (<= 80 mOhm) + 4.7 uF, VBAT 22 uF + 100 nF via 120R bead, VDDIO 4.7 uF + 100 nF via bead,\nPCIe 100 nF on both lane directions, 100 pF on REFCLK (as Edge2). VDDIO = VCC_1V8_S3 so Wi-Fi/BT survive suspend.\nControl pins as the Orange Pi CM5 tablet board (Wi-Fi/BT on GPIO0, 1.8 V): WL_REG_ON GPIO0_D0, WL_HOST_WAKE GPIO0_A0,\nBT_WAKE GPIO0_C6, BT_HOST_WAKE GPIO0_C5, UART9_M2; BT_REG_ON on GPIO0_C7 (tablet: D3, which has a default pull-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c5a2517f-f0d0-47e6-b6e9-16fc6ad56082")
	)
	(text "PCIe lane and sidebands"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "280dc65e-7b37-408f-abee-e20ef2042f94")
	)
	(text "Sidebands PCIE20X1_2 *_M0: CLKREQ# GPIO3_C7 (JP3.22), PERST# GPIO3_D1 (JP3.24), WAKE#\nGPIO3_D0 (JP3.43) are 1.8 V on the Orange Pi CM5 = AP6275P VDDIO: direct. CLKREQ# / PME# are open-drain: 10k to 1.8 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2289027b-53f3-4db8-99b8-10157a15aeb4")
	)
	(text "Antenna ports (2 x U.FL, 50 Ohm coplanar)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe3c8194-f2ad-48dc-a4a8-235797aca258")
	)
	(text "Series 0 Ohm + unfitted shunt pads for a pi match (as Edge2)."
